H. K. D. H. Bhadeshia and Haixue Yan. Phase Transitions, author-hosted introductory textbook. [Book, complete source, and licence](https://www.phase-trans.msm.cam.ac.uk/2025/PT-book.html) · [Authorized PDF](https://www.phase-trans.msm.cam.ac.uk/2022/EMS523U_book.pdf).

Read the entire book and work its examples: introduction, elementary thermodynamics, equilibrium, diffusion and further diffusion mechanisms, nucleation, solidification, iron-carbon behavior, and precipitation. It is an introductory university treatment; later whole books, primary papers, and independent projects supply further depth.

The authors explicitly provide the book and source files under CC BY 4.0. Preserve their attribution and component acknowledgments. Record the actual PDF revision; a hosting-directory year is not sufficient evidence of publication date. The author page, contents outline, download route, and licence were verified on 29 October 2026. The PDF exceeded the browser's size limit, so complete PDF inspection is not claimed. No book/source archive is bundled.

